---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Prequalification" description="Vendor prequalification package from Potential Electrical: insurance, EMR, OSHA 300A, bonding, W-9, JSA, utility avoidance plan and daily report." path="/prequalification/">
<section id="prequal-page"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="prequal" id="prequal">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Prequalification</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-top:10px">Get us through vendor onboarding in a day.</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Email <b style="color:var(--ink)">info@potentialelectrical.com</b> and we send the full package the same day. Verify our license directly with the <a href="https://www.cslb.ca.gov/OnlineServices/CheckLicenseII/LicenseDetail.aspx?LicNum=996042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CSLB</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="docs">
      <li>Certificate of insurance</li><li>EMR letter, 5 years</li><li>OSHA 300A summaries</li><li>Bonding letter</li><li>W-9 and DIR registration</li><li><a href="https://netorg126705.sharepoint.com/:b:/g/IQAQqm20ol3GTaFoudZzDLQ1AenGYHbOBSNkVpV5xXER1Z0?e=13ozg1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Job safety analysis (JSA) ↗</a></li><li><a href="https://netorg126705.sharepoint.com/:b:/g/IQD9csY6VUylRIFbJMKlrynmAdTlS-EoHoZy7bDxGmXGcdU?e=SG4Rbq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Utility avoidance plan ↗</a></li><li><a href="https://netorg126705.sharepoint.com/:b:/g/IQBvZwLbvVC3R6tcliQe5bonATOgw5lcSefnJQi7jBTsozs?e=kDYNNQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Daily report example ↗</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div></section>
<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
